pacitance, switch resistance, sampling instant/duration/repetition and sample capacitor prior voltage; source impedance/rise time and actual initial filter charge; real component tolerance/leakage/bias/temperature behavior; interconnect/connector/cable/return parasitics and resulting transient impedance; fabricated hardware and oscilloscope measurements; assembly/part-specific footprint validation, fab process capability and thermal measurements. Original ERC was reviewed but not rerun. Ignored native rules remain as listed in original ERC/DRC and the independent DRC output. No external references were fetched because no part models or externally specified ratings were used.\n'\"''')\nr=json.loads(Path('/work/experiments/independent_drc.json').read_text())\nprint({k:r[k] for k in ['ignored_checks','violations','unconnected_items','schematic_parity']})\nprint('Experiment files:', sorted(x.name for x in p.parent.iterdir() if x.is_file()))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"{'ignored_checks': [{'description': 'Footprint has no courtyard defined', 'key': 'missing_courtyard'}, {'description': 'Track endpoint not centered on via', 'key': 'track_not_centered_on_via'}, {'description': 'Tuning profile track geometries', 'key': 'tuning_profile_track_geometries'}, {'description': \"Footprint doesn't match symbol's footprint filters\", 'key': 'footprint_filters_mismatch'}, {'description': \"Footprint component type doesn't match footprint pads\", 'key': 'footprint_type_mismatch'}], 'violations': [], 'unconnected_items': [], 'schematic_parity': []}\nExperiment files: ['calculate_response.py', 'independent_drc.json', 'independent_netlist.xml', 'inspect_physical.py', 'native_commands.json', 'ngspice_baseline.log', 'nominal_baseline.cir', 'physical_inspection.json', 'response_calculation.json', 'review_log.md', 'run_native_checks.py', 'saved_copper.png', 'versions.json']\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
